meta {
  name: 08-Media
  seq: 8
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{tenantAAccessToken}}
}

headers {
  Host: {{tenantAHost}}
}

docs {
  Requires EDITOR or TENANT_ADMIN + DIGITAL_CONTENT module. Flow: upload-url -> client PUT to uploadUrl (outside Bruno) -> confirm -> preview-url. Without a real PUT, confirm returns 400 UPLOAD_VALIDATION_FAILED, which is expected.
}
